/-! Stage 19. Preserve all physical conclusions when applying Theorem 17.
The degree certificate records unreduced numerator/denominator degrees and
excludes every common complex root; this is the minimal rational order. -/
namespace MIACE
open MeasureTheory Filter Set Polynomial
